From: Jihad Hanna <jihadghanna@google.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:07:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] Hide stale datalist popup when active field or session
 changes

Ensure the datalist popup in AndroidAutofillProvider is dismissed when
the active field changes or loses its datalist options in
UpdateCurrentField(), as well as when starting or canceling an autofill
session in AutofillProvider.java.

More details in the bug report.

Fixed: 574635898
Change-Id: I5b42b7d8e95e9ea0f028aca17a3117348d7e70ba
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8606209
Commit-Queue: Jihad Hanna <jihadghanna@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Jan Keitel <jkeitel@google.com>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1722680}
(cherry picked from commit 677776cf3aa5cfdbf57fcc086c27773f4575825f)
